+# R87 myth cluster: The First Answering
+
+This fixture presents a small fictional cosmology in which two shore factions keep separate beacons, an item marks the transition from dark sea to lamp-light, and their accounts of an alliance are independently recorded. The sources are in-world evidence labels for this fixture, not external claims about real traditions.
+
+The item claims are mapped clause-by-clause in `symbolism-clause-map.md`. `sourced-inspiration.md` names one high-level real-world mythology parallel and keeps attribution, rights, and AI-training permission as separate open questions. It does not establish a canon link or resolve any of those questions.
+
+Run the fixture validator from the repository root:
+
+```sh
+python3 corpus/fixtures/check_bible.py corpus/fixtures/r87-myth-cluster
+```
